<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-JONES WINS WORLD WOMEN'S 100 METRES TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-JONES WINS WORLD WOMEN'S 100 METRES TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marion Jones won the women's 100 metres gold medal on the second day of the world championships on Sunday.</p>
<p>Zhanna Pintussevich of the Ukraine took the silver and Bahamian Sevatheda Fynes the bronze.</p>
